:"c-shiji-033-lu:p025","quote":"伯御即位十一年，周宣王伐魯，殺其君伯御，而問魯公子能道順諸矦者，以爲魯後。樊穆仲曰：『魯懿公弟稱，肅恭明神，敬事耆老；賦事行刑，必問於遺訓而咨於固實；不干所問，不犯所（知）［咨］。』宣王曰：『然，能訓治其民矣。』乃立稱於夷宮，是爲孝公。自是後，諸矦多畔王命。"}],"rationale":"按懿公被弒至魯文公的敘事角色、同段明示子／弟與柯盟、齊襄公殺魯桓公、晉立惠公等具體事件暫定異稱；同字爵稱依國別分開。公子揮不與前篇公子翚、晉襄父不與晉襄公、宣伯不與叔孫宣伯自動合併。數位疑讀與親屬異說仍待核對。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p024","text":"懿公九年，懿公兄括之子伯御與魯人攻弒懿公，而立伯御爲君。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m024-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"懿公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001225","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m024-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"懿公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001225","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m024-0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"括","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001224","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m024-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"伯御","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001227","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m024-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"魯人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未指名者、地點氏稱、未定官稱或未解指代；不補姓名、成員與父系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m024-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"懿公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001225","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m024-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"伯御","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001227","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","book_id":"b-shiji-033","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p025","text":"伯御即位十一年，周宣王伐魯，殺其君伯御，而問魯公子能道順諸矦者，以爲魯後。樊穆仲曰：『魯懿公弟稱，肅恭明神，敬事耆老；賦事行刑，必問於遺訓而咨於固實；不干所問，不犯所（知）［咨］。』宣王曰：『然，能訓治其民矣。』乃立稱於夷宮，是爲孝公。自是後，諸矦多畔王命。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m025-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"伯御","kind":"person","person_i